+<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta charset="utf-8"><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"><title>Code IDE Help — Code IDE</title></head><body><h1>Code IDE Help</h1><p>This is the help page for Code IDE, an Android source code editor with many features.</p><ul><li><a href="pages/editor.html">Editing</a> An overview of the main editing functions of Code IDE</li><li><a href="pages/menus.html">UI Layouts</a> The different possible UI layout configurations</li><li><a href="pages/files.html">File Management</a> How to create, open and save files</li><li><a href="pages/encodings.html">File Encodings</a> Creating and saving files using different encodings.</li><li><a href="pages/remote.html">Remote Files</a> How to connect and manage files in remote locations using Dropbox, Box, SFTP, FTP and FTPS</li><li><a href="pages/syntax.html">Syntax Highlighting</a> Configuring the correct syntax highlighting for each type of file</li><li><a href="pages/emmet.html">Emmet 2.4.11</a> Skróty HTML, CSS i JSX działające offline</li><li><a href="pages/shortcuts.html">Keyboard Shortcuts</a> Configuring and using shortcuts (even without a physical keyboard)</li><li><a href="pages/appearance.html">Appearance</a> Configuring the general appearance of Code IDE</li><li><a href="pages/running.html">Running</a> Ways to execute code directly from Code IDE</li><li><a href="pages/homeshortcuts.html">Home Screen Shortcuts</a> Placing a shortcut to a specific file on you home screen</li></ul><br><ul><li><a href="pages/about.html">About</a> About Code IDE</li><li><a href="pages/licenses.html">Licenses</a> Open source licenses</li></ul><div class="modder"><p class="subtitle">Current version</p><h2 class="title">20261117</h2><a class="modder-link" href="https://github.com/TiedWithType/code_ide/releases/latest">Check for updates →</a></div></body></html>
